        "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-344438\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">2.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"344438\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\">The sides (in meters) of a square are decreasing. At a particular moment, the rate of decrease of the area of the square is numerically equal to twelve times the rate of decrease of the sides. What is the area <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"17\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of the square at that moment?<div class=\"freeResponseLine\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"18\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\n<div ;=\"\" class=\"freeResponseTextbox\" id=\"freeResponseTextbox-1\" style=\"min-width:31px;\n                                        margin-left:2px;\n                                        margin-right:1px;\n                                        background:;\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"19\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>36</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></div><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"20\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cA0\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mtext> m</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></div></div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 10:11 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:15</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>",
