        "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-115924\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">4.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"115924\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>The sides (in meters) of a square are decreasing. At a particular moment, the rate of decrease of the area of the square is numerically equal to ten times the rate of decrease of the sides. What is the length of the sides of the square at that moment?</p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 10:12 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:15</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>",
        "answer_validation": {
