        "dom_id": "question-116049",
        "name": "Question 12",
        "problem": "![](images/bb/bbd79b56420475595834e8cd67d4b9d3d5ca8a2e0fda399f49de1f4e9bb26c95.png)\n\nIf the diagonals of a square increase at a rate of $4\\sqrt{2}\\text{ feet}\\text{/hour}$, at what rate is the perimeter changing?",
        "worked_solution": "Let $p$ be the perimeter of the square, and $h$ be the length of the diagonal. The relationship between $p$ and $h$ is\n\n$$\np=2\\sqrt{2}h.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating this relationship with respect to $t$ using implicit differentiation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(p) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2\\sqrt{2}h) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}p}{\\text{d}t} & =\\frac{\\text{d}h}{\\text{d}t}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}h}(2\\sqrt{2}h) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}p}{\\text{d}t} & =\\frac{\\text{d}h}{\\text{d}t}\\cdot 2\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe're told that each diagonal of the square is increasing at a rate of $4\\sqrt{2}\\text{ feet}\\text{/hour},$ so we have \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}h}{\\text{d}t}=4\\sqrt{2}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting this information into the above expression for $\\frac{\\text{d}p}{\\text{d}t}$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}p}{\\text{d}t} & =(4\\sqrt{2})\\cdot (2\\sqrt{2})=16\\text{ feet/hour}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the perimeter of the square increases at $16\\text{ feet}/\\text{hour}.$",
        "answer_fields_complete": true,
        "result": "Incorrect",
        "html": "<div id=\"question-116049\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">12.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"116049\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionGraphicFrame\"><img class=\"questionGraphic\" src=\"/graphics/q-116049\"></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>If the diagonals of a square increase at a rate of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"169\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msqrt><mjx-sqrt><mjx-surd><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-surd><mjx-box style=\"padding-top: 0.174em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-box></mjx-sqrt></mjx-msqrt><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cA0\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c66\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c68\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c75\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c72\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mtext>&nbsp;feet</mtext><mtext>/hour</mtext></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, at what rate is the perimeter changing?</p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyHard\">H</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 10:15 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:18</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>",
