ltyHard\">H</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 10:18 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:20</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>",
