 <use xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"1910\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"2411\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> and therefore the area of the square at that moment is</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"12.802ex\" height=\"5.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1652.5 5512 2443.8\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-11-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-11-Title\">\nA = \\dfrac{2^2}{2} = 2.\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E11-MJMATHI-41\" d=\"M208 74Q208 50 254 46Q272 46 272 35Q272 34 270 22Q267 8 264 4T251 0Q249 0 239 0T205 1T141 2Q70 2 50 0H42Q35 7 35 11Q37 38 48 46H62Q132 49 164 96Q170 102 345 401T523 704Q530 716 547 716H555H572Q578 707 578 706L606 383Q634 60 636 57Q641 46 701 46Q726 46 726 36Q726 34 723 22Q720 7 718 4T704 0Q701 0 690 0T651 1T578 2Q484 2 455 0H443Q437 6 437 9T439 27Q443 40 445 43L449 46H469Q523 49 533 63L521 213H283L249 155Q208 86 208 74ZM516 260Q516 271 504 416T490 562L463 519Q447 492 400 412L310 260L413 259Q516 259 516 260Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E11-MJMAIN-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E11-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E11-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMATHI-41\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"1028\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(2084,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"1074\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n<g transform=\"translate(60,676)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"707\" y=\"557\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"286\" y=\"-687\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"3676\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(4733,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMAIN-32\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n\n            </div>           \n        </div>",
        "html_path": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14210206/observations/lesson-step-895-76e33e6cfb46e3632e11.html",
