          "title": "Calculating the Rate of Change of the Area Given the Rate of Change of the Side Length",
          "position": 1,
          "dom_id": "step-887",
          "html": "<div class=\"step\" contentid=\"218\" id=\"step-887\" stepid=\"887\" steptype=\"example\" style=\"display: block\">\n<div class=\"stepHeader\">\n<div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a class=\"stepAnchor\" id=\"stepAnchor-887\" name=\"step-2\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Calculating the Rate of Change of the Area Given the Rate of Change of the Side Length</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"887\">?</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            t