o><mi>h</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></menclose></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></menclose></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>So at that particular moment, we have that the length of the diagonals of the square is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"200\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cA0\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c66\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mtext>&nbsp;feet</mtext><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
